false},{"Uid":"GameFramework.Services.Interfaces","Type":"namespace","File":"api/GameFramework.Services.Interfaces.yml","Metadata":{},"IsExplicitInterfaceImplementation":false},{"Uid":"GameFramework.EventSystem.Events.PlayerLookInputEvent","Type":"class","Syntax":{"content":"public class PlayerLookInputEvent","content.vb":"Public Class PlayerLookInputEvent"},"File":"api/GameFramework.EventSystem.Events.PlayerLookInputEvent.yml","Metadata":{},"IsExplicitInterfaceImplementation":false},{"Uid":"GameFramework.EventSystem.Events.PlayerLookInputEvent.LookDelta","Type":"property","Syntax":{"content":"public Vector2 LookDelta { get; }","parameters":[],"return":{"type":"Vector2"},"content.vb":"Public ReadOnly Property LookDelta As Vector2"},"File":"api/GameFramework.EventSystem.Events.PlayerLookInputEvent.yml","Metadata":{"type":"property","summary":null,"platform":null},"IsExplicitInterfaceImplementation":false},{"Uid":"GameFramework.EventSystem.Events.PlayerLookInputEvent.Phase","Type":"property","Syntax":{"content":"public InputActionPhase Phase { get; }","parameters":[],"return":{"type":"InputActionPhase"},"content.vb":"Public ReadOnly Property Phase As InputActionPhase"},"File":"api/GameFramework.EventSystem.Events.PlayerLookInputEvent.yml","Metadata":{"type":"property","summary":null,"platform":null},"IsExplicitInterfaceImplementation":false},{"Uid":"GameFramework.EventSystem.Events.PlayerLookInputEvent.#ctor(Vector2,InputActionPhase)","Type":"constructor","Syntax":{"content":"public PlayerLookInputEvent(Vector2 lookDelta, InputActionPhase phase)","parameters":[{"id":"lookDelta","type":"Vector2"},{"id":"phase","type":"InputActionPhase"}],"content.vb":"Public Sub New(lookDelta As Vector2, phase As InputActionPhase)"},"File":"api/GameFramework.EventSystem.Events.PlayerLookInputEvent.yml","Metadata":{"type":"constructor","summary":null,"platform":null},"IsExplicitInterfaceImplementation":false},{"Uid":"GameFramework.EventSystem.Events.GameResumedEvent","Type":"class","Syntax":{"content":"public class GameResumedEvent","content.vb":"Public Class GameResumedEvent"},"File":"api/GameFramework.EventSystem.Events.GameResumedEvent.yml","Metadata":{},"IsExplicitInterfaceImplementation":false},{"Uid":"GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService","Summary":"<p sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"2\" sourceendlinenumber=\"2\">Service that orchestrates the debug console system using dependency injection.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\" sourceendlinenumber=\"4\">Architecture:</p>\n<ul sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\" sourceendlinenumber=\"8\">\n<li sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\" sourceendlinenumber=\"5\">Manages console state (open/closed)</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"6\" sourceendlinenumber=\"6\">Provides public API for other systems to interact with console</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"7\" sourceendlinenumber=\"7\">Respects debug settings from configuration</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"8\" sourceendlinenumber=\"8\">Input conflict management is handled by ConsoleInputHandler</li>\n</ul>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"10\" sourceendlinenumber=\"10\">Flow:</p>\n<ol sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"11\" sourceendlinenumber=\"15\">\n<li sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"11\" sourceendlinenumber=\"11\">Receives toggle input events from InputManager</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"12\" sourceendlinenumber=\"12\">Checks if console is enabled in debug settings</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"13\" sourceendlinenumber=\"13\">Updates console open/closed state only if enabled</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"14\" sourceendlinenumber=\"14\">ConsoleInputHandler automatically manages input conflicts by checking IsConsoleOpen()</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"15\" sourceendlinenumber=\"15\">Delegates UI updates to ConsoleGUI via Console static class</li>\n</ol>\n","Type":"class","Syntax":{"content":"public class ConsoleService : IConsoleService","content.vb":"Public Class ConsoleService\n    Inherits IConsoleService"},"File":"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml","Metadata":{},"IsExplicitInterfaceImplementation":false},{"Uid":"GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.#ctor(ConsoleGUI,IEventSystem,IConfigService)","Summary":"<p sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"2\" sourceendlinenumber=\"2\">Constructor injection - DI container provides all dependencies</p>\n","Type":"constructor","Syntax":{"content":"public ConsoleService(ConsoleGUI consoleGUI, IEventSystem eventSystem, IConfigService configService)","parameters":[{"id":"consoleGUI","type":"ConsoleGUI"},{"id":"eventSystem","type":"IEventSystem"},{"id":"configService","type":"IConfigService"}],"content.vb":"Public Sub New(consoleGUI As ConsoleGUI, eventSystem As IEventSystem, configService As IConfigService)"},"File":"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml","Metadata":{"type":"constructor","summary":"<p sourcefile=\"api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"2\" sourceendlinenumber=\"2\">Constructor injection - DI container provides all dependencies</p>\n","platform":null},"IsExplicitInterfaceImplementation":false},{"Uid":"GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.IsIni